{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\n\nF43A, F43B, and F44 are approved. MCP authentication documentation calls four implemented strategies unavailable. An SSO module links to a missing runbook. S3 guidance and ADR 0093 prescribe a rejected config command form.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Describe static, JWT, introspection, proxy, and custom MCP authentication strategies as implemented.\n- Correct AuthConfigError documentation without changing fail-closed behavior.\n- Link the approved SSO module reference to infra/runbooks/sso-auth-host.md.\n- Replace rebar config -c with persistent sync.remote configuration in rebar.toml.\n- Preserve ADR 0093 decision substance and status.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] MCP authentication module documentation describes all five implemented strategies.\n- [ ] AuthConfigError documentation matches the implemented error contract.\n- [ ] The approved missing runbook reference resolves to infra/runbooks/sso-auth-host.md.\n- [ ] S3 setup examples use supported persistent project configuration.\n- [ ] S3 back-out examples use supported persistent project configuration.\n- [ ] Authentication behavior remains unchanged.\n- [ ] S3 behavior remains unchanged.\n- [ ] ADR 0093 decision substance remains unchanged.\n- [ ] ADR 0093 status remains unchanged.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] The commands in Verification pass.\n  provenance:\n    environment: Worktree docs-f43-f44-20260824 at d14a145500125798e781e9274219683aa32cef50\n    principal: RebarBotNava using joeoakhart@navapbc.com\n    privilege: Ordinary contributor access with the project virtual environment\n    instrument: Focused pytest, make lint, make typecheck, and git diff --check\n    source: Timestamped command results recorded in a ticket comment after merge\n- [ ] The separate auth/RUNBOOK.md reference remains outside this approved scope.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_auth.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_auth_introspection.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_auth_custom.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_auth_jwks.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_auth_proxy.py tests/unit/test_sync_remote_config.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make typecheck`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Inspect the S3 examples against the sync.remote configuration model.\n- Inspect the authentication documentation against the implemented verifier classes and AuthConfigError call sites."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787602577108688001,"uuid":"b7e57209-f9eb-4af8-84b5-f718c813083e"}